{"GroupPermissionsV2.canManage() returns true when the caller has only VIEW permission on the Groups resource type, which can incorrectly satisfy requireManage() checks for group-mutating endpoints, enabling a caller granted only view access to create/update groups": 0.9835376143455505, "GroupPermissionsV2.getGroupIdsWithViewPermission() uses authorization Resource IDs (UUIDs) instead of Keycloak group IDs and relies on findByType(\"Groups\") even though per-group resources created by AdminPermissionsSchema are not assigned a type, making user search/count filtering based on group visibility incorrect (often empty/zero) and can cause hard-deny behavior when an all-groups permission exists": 0.9874863624572754}